    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored while waiting for something to load?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't keep your hands still when thinking about a problem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desktop slot machine will fill these tiny pockets of time, whether you're waiting for something to load or just daydreaming. Give this mini slot machine a try and see if you can get lucky. Of course, it won't offer you any real rewards :P</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Click the area with the symbol on the wheel to start the lottery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Long press and drag the area of the colored lights to move the slot machine freely on the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Right-click the slot machine to open the menu, including zoom (display at 25% or 50% size), layer adjustment, volume adjustment, and exit game button.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored while waiting for something to load?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't keep your hands still when thinking about a problem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desktop slot machine will fill these tiny pockets of time, whether you're waiting for something to load or just daydreaming. Give this mini slot machine a try and see if you can get lucky. Of course, it won't offer you any real rewards :P</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Click the area with the symbol on the wheel to start the lottery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Long press and drag the area of the colored lights to move the slot machine freely on the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Right-click the slot machine to open the menu, including zoom (display at 25% or 50% size), layer adjustment, volume adjustment, and exit game button.</p>",
    "short_description": "Place a slot machine on your desktop. It can help you get through the boring waiting time. Click on this mini slot machine at any time to try your luck.",
